	(text_box "The Chameleon does not have a 8255 PPI chip that provided the standard PC keyboard interface.\nIt emulates writing to the PPI's Port B via the \"KBD\" PAL - only the data bits that have any meaning on a Chameleon are run to it.\n\nReading Port B is handled quite a distance away by U162. It doesn't appear that SPEAKER_DATA does anything."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
