	)
	(text_box "Unexpectedly, pin 3 of the keyboard header is tied to the board's ~{RESET} signal. It is unclear what purpose this served - maybe it assisted in testing. It does not appear to be wired into the Chameleon keyboard's circuitry."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
